\"label\":\"Contact\",\"url\":\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} \/--><!-- \/wp:navigation --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/header><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Main\"}} --><main class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:custom\/layout-shell {\"wrappers\":[{\"tagName\":\"section\",\"attributes\":{\"class\":\"wp-block-group hero\"}},{\"tagName\":\"div\",\"attributes\":{\"class\":\"wp-block-group wrap\"}}]} --><section class=\"wp-block-group hero\"><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} --><h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your bike, running like the day you got it<\/h1><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A small repair workshop in Larkbend. Tune-ups, wheel builds and cargo bike care, done while you wait or by the next morning.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"blocks-engine-synthetic-paragraph\"} --><p class=\"blocks-engine-synthetic-paragraph\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Book a repair<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><\/section><!-- \/wp:custom\/layout-shell --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we do<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"cards\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-grid wp-block-group-is-layout-grid cards\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\",\"tagName\":\"article\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Tune-ups\"}} --><article class=\"wp-block-group card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tune-ups<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Gears indexed, brakes set, chain cleaned and every bolt checked to torque.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"blocks-engine-synthetic-paragraph\"} --><p class=\"blocks-engine-synthetic-paragraph\"><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html#tune-ups\">See tune-up levels<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/article><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\",\"tagName\":\"article\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Wheels\"}} --><article class=\"wp-block-group card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wheels<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Truing, spoke replacement and hand-built wheels for road, gravel and town bikes.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"blocks-engine-synthetic-paragraph\"} --><p class=\"blocks-engine-synthetic-paragraph\"><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html#wheels\">See wheel work<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/article><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\",\"tagName\":\"article\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Cargo bikes\"}} --><article class=\"wp-block-group card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cargo bikes<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Longtails and front-loaders, with the space and the stands to work on them properly.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"blocks-engine-synthetic-paragraph\"} --><p class=\"blocks-engine-synthetic-paragraph\"><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html#cargo\">See cargo care<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/article><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Open today<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:html --><p class=\"open-row\">\n          <svg class=\"icon-wrench\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" viewbox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"wrench-title\">\n            \n            <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#e9a64b\"><\/circle>\n            <path d=\"M30 10a8 8 0 0 0-7.6 10.4L11 31.8 16.2 37l11.4-11.4A8 8 0 0 0 38 18l-5 2-4-4 2-5z\" fill=\"#1f4e5f\"><\/path>\n          <\/svg>\n          <span id=\"open-status\">The workshop is open Tuesday to Saturday, 9:00 to 17:30.<\/span>\n        <\/p><!-- \/wp:html --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>They had my commuter back the same afternoon, and it shifts better than it did new.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><cite>A rider from Larkbend (a made-up quote for this test)<\/cite><\/blockquote><!-- \/wp:quote --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/main><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"site-footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Footer\"}} --><footer class=\"wp-block-group site-footer\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap footer-cols\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap footer-cols\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quillfern Cycle Works<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>14 Ferrule Lane, Larkbend<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pages<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/about.html\">About<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html\">Services<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Contact<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Quillfern Cycle Works is a fictional business, made for a software test.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>\u00a9 <mark class=\"year\" style=\"background-color:transparent;color:inherit\" role=\"none\">2026<\/mark> Sample site, MIT licence.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/footer><!-- \/wp:group -->"
